plausible reason to believe that there was a genocide being committed. I think anything else

3
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:28,400
would have been very difficult to stomach. It absolutely isolates Israel on the world stage.

4
00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:32,940
It puts the world on notice that unlike what Israel has told the world, that this court is saying

5
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:38,640
this is not a legitimate operation, that the targets are actually civilians, that there is

6
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:44,720
risk of irreparable harm, that the rate of starvation, the lack of deprivation of electricity,

7
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:51,840
the denial of quarter are all tantamount to probably constituting genocide and a failure

8
