to stop genocide that Israel's top military and political echelons have indicated an intent

9
00:00:58,600 --> 00:01:11,860
to target all Palestinians to destroy them. This didn't happen behind closed doors. This happened

10
00:01:11,860 --> 00:01:18,020
as we were bearing witness. And I see now in the ICJ decision, another opportunity and a mechanism

11
00:01:18,020 --> 00:01:25,460
in order to further isolate Israel, to impose weapons sanctions on Israel, in order to encourage third

12
